13 0 1
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
Vash Theory Magic~
This scroll seems to detail Vash's theory of Magical Shielding.
 It states that a magical shield can be held for eternity if
those that are bound by the magic actively work to
destroy it. It is in this that the magical shielding would have
an eternal power source, even if the creatures that were
contained stopped trying to break the seal, any attempt
would power it for eons.
~
#9954
Vilutu History Elder~
Vilutu's account of the Elder Gods~
A tattered scroll lies on the floor.

~
~
13 0 1
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
Vilutu Scroll Elder~
This scroll has a first hand account of the Elder Gods as they
rampaged through the realm before Drazuk's victory.

 "I don't know how long our defenses will hold. The creatures are
too many, too ravenous, and some say too powerful to
ever be stopped. The ones that fly yet take the shape of sea
life often act as a distracting force. These creatures are fast
and unyielding.  The others then proceed to move behind them
after our defenses are to entangled to keep them at bay.  The lizardmen
city to the west has already fallen, they were our strongest ally. The humans
quake in fear behind their stone buildings.  The dwarves have locked
themselves in the mountain. The elves magic is not strong enough to
seal away their Leader, this Sultan. He decimates our armies as if
his creatures were not enough. No where is safe. Our hero's are failing,
and our Martyr's memories are fading.  Where these creatures came
from I do not know but only through a great victory of cunning will
we be able to survive."
~
