18 0 1048577
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
Warrior Pride~
This odd magical representation of the Pride that Luz de Penumbra held
 pulsates with his memories.  You look as the events of his life
 are replayed.  You see the war with the Elder Gods, Penumbra's
envy of Synot, the leader of his people, and their final defeat.
You see a wounded Synot call out to his brother and watch with
disgust as Penumbra seals Synot into a dark prison.  With some
amount of satisfaction you see Penumbra thrown into this
prison with the other Ancients.
~
#9964
Death Tear Synot~
Synot's Tear in Death~
This magical eruption of power could be your way out!

~
~
18 0 1048577
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
Tear Death Synot~
This magical rupture of time and space seems to be Synot's
gift to you.  He is not only trapped behind these barriers
but removed from even a quiet death.  But even a creature
such as him cannot be removed of all power and he has
graciously provided you a way out.
~
