#9976
Tome History Ancient~
the Tome of the Ancients~
This huge tome seems to be filled to the brim.

~
~
13 0 1
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
Tome History Ancient~
The writing on the tome is in a bizarre language of
symbols and glyphs. Yet as you scan the pages
you notice a few begin to twist and turn into
your own native tongue!

"We are lost.  The great beasts found our sanctuary, it has been
obliterated. All we have left is this simple school. Our great lord
Synot has formed a protective barrier to hide us from
the eyes of these Daemons.  The Abbott died early this
night, his last moments were spent screaming.  His link
to Synot was broken and this can mean only one thing:
Synot has failed.  The other Ancients, our protectors
and teachers have been wiped out.  Most of our kind
has also perished with them, the psychic links that
allowed us to communicate have been broken
destroying the body and mind of both sides. The Sensei
left must mean that some have survived, and he believes
they are locked away in some dark place. He will later attempt
to open a vortex to their prison and allow them safe passage
back to our most humble home. I pray that Synot is merely
sleeping, much like the great beast that he buried into the sea.
Death cannot be strong enough to take our Lord Lodhal.
We shall wait here, and tend to their last mark on this realm
and hope that one day they awaken.
~
